@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search：[English](README.en.md)

DSH PCB 元器件搜索工具插件 —— 按关键词搜索 IC / 有源 / 无源电子元器件，用于 PCB 设计与 EDA 选型。通过芯灵（eda.cn）queryPage 接口查询，默认只返回带 EDA 模型（原理图符号 / PCB 封装）的器件。

[](LICENSE)

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · 示例：```
pcb_parts_search { keyword: "STM32F103C8T6" }
  → [{ "mpn": "STM32F103C8T6", "mfgid": "8598", "description": "...", "datasheet": "..." }]

pcb_parts_search { keyword: "0402 10k resistor", page_size: 10 }

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · 验证安装：```sh
dsh --profile web --dump-config | grep tool-pcb-parts-search
```

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · 运行验证：```sh
dsh run "使用 pcb_parts_search 工具搜索 STM32F103C8T6"
```

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search：[中文](README.md)

DSH PCB parts search tool plugin — search ICs / active / passive electronic components by keyword for PCB design and EDA part selection. Queries the eda.cn (芯灵) queryPage API; by default only returns parts with EDA models (schematic symbol / PCB footprint) so results are directly usable in design.

[](LICENSE)

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · Motivation：1. **Spawning a process every call** — especially expensive on Windows, and model-written HTTP requests are error-prone
2. **Unstructured results** — the model extracts MPN, description, and datasheet URLs from raw HTML; missing fields and messy formats are the norm
3. **No designability guarantee** — found parts may lack EDA models (schematic symbol / PCB footprint), and only after placing them in the design does the user discover they can't be laid out

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · Architecture：- `src/index.ts`: Cordis plugin entry (`name`/`inject`/`apply`); registers the `pcb_parts_search` tool; includes parameter defense, result mapping, and text rendering
- `src/queryPage.ts`: `queryPageSearch(keyword, options): Promise<QueryPagePart[]>` — calls the eda.cn API, validates HTTP + business code, flattens the nested structure
- `src/invariant.ts`: invariant companion plugin (no runtime invariant; behavior covered by tests)

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · Examples：```
pcb_parts_search { keyword: "STM32F103C8T6" }
  → [{ "mpn": "STM32F103C8T6", "mfgid": "8598", "description": "...", "datasheet": "..." }]

pcb_parts_search { keyword: "0402 10k resistor", page_size: 10 }

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · Verify Installation：```sh
dsh --profile web --dump-config | grep tool-pcb-parts-search
```

@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-pcb-parts-search README · Runtime Verification：```sh
dsh run "Use the pcb_parts_search tool to search for STM32F103C8T6"
```
